---
title: Overview
description: What Operon is, the three user roles, and how the screen is arranged.
sidebar:
  order: 1
---

Operon is where your firm's staff and its AI employees work together. The AI employees do the first pass of the work — they read documents, prepare filings and books, and draft what needs drafting — and your staff check, decide and sign off. This chapter covers what every user needs on the first day: getting into the account, keeping it secure, finding your way around, and talking to an AI employee.

## User roles

Every user of a firm has one of three roles. The administrator sets the role when the user is created.

| Role | What it adds |
|---|---|
| **Member** | Works on the cases, boards and documents that the member has access to. |
| **Manager** | Also starts cases for the department, and sees the work of the people who report to the manager. |
| **Tenant admin** | Also manages the firm's users, departments, AI employees and settings, and can open everything in the firm. A tenant admin must use two-step verification (see [Two-step verification and account security](/en/getting-started/account-security/)). |

What a user can see also depends on the department and on the access that the administrator grants to each suite (for example, Secretary or Tax).

## The screen

The left side bar is the main menu. It is collapsed to icons by default; select the logo at the top to open or close it. The items are:

| Item | Use |
|---|---|
| **Home** | Your AI employees and a box to send them a message. See [Home and AI employees](/en/getting-started/home-ai-employees/). |
| **Workspace** | Cases, boards and the work of each suite. See [Workspaces and cases](/en/getting-started/workspaces-cases/). |
| **Clients** | Your client companies and contacts. Shown to users with access to the CRM or Secretary suite. |
| **Team** | The firm's directory: departments, colleagues and AI employees. |
| **Documents** | The firm's document library. |
| **Invoices** | Invoices to your clients. See [Invoices](/en/invoices/overview/). |
| **E-Sign** | Documents sent for signature online. See [E-Sign](/en/e-sign/overview/). |
| **Notifications** | Messages about your tasks, approvals and the system. The number on the icon is the count of unread notifications. |
| **Settings** | Your own settings. See [Personal settings and help](/en/getting-started/settings-help/). |
| **Admin** | The firm's administration. Shown to tenant admins only. |
| **User manual** | Opens this manual in a new tab, in the language of your interface. |
| **Contact support** | The support e-mail address, with **Send email** and **Copy address**. |

Your avatar is at the bottom of the side bar. Select it for **Settings**, **Privacy**, **Notifications**, **Admin** (tenant admins only) and **Log out**.

